{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:fce4283174bc5e85","name":"Interchangeable Weapon System","source":{"id":"source:reference-fce4283174bc5e85","title":"Interchangeable Weapon System","revision":20883,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:42:33Z","sha256":"4bc869a27c85d13c949af98b7d238381a2aa20d3a01fe9b0d161a7a996083f51","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20883","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Interchangeable%20Weapon%20System&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-fce4283174bc5e85","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The DC-17m Interchangeable Weapon System (also called the DC-17m ICWS) is a weapon unique to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Commandos"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Commandos"},". The varying demands of the battlefield and the Clone Commandos' atypical missions led BlasTech to design this weapon to fill three different roles. The basic configuration is a standard ",{"tag":"a","children":["Blaster Rifle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Blaster_Rifle","referenceId":"reference:fb78a988cbf9557f"},". Additional attachments, however, can be added to transform the weapon into a Sniper Rifle or an Anti-Armor Grenade Launcher. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Commandos"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Commandos"}," appreciate the versatility of the ICWS, which reduces the weight they carry by reducing the number of their weapons.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["An Interchangeable Weapon System can be switched among three different modes: standard Blaster-Rifle Mode, Sniper-Rifle Mode, and Anti-Armor Mode. Switching weapon modes is a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Blaster-Rifle Mode"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["In Blaster-Rifle Mode, the ICWS functions like a regular ",{"tag":"a","children":["Blaster Rifle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Blaster_Rifle","referenceId":"reference:fb78a988cbf9557f"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rifles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rifles","referenceId":"reference:a6ebe3ecc8b0b281"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Medium\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 4,500\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 3d8\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," Setting:"]}," YES\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Rate of Fire:"]}," Single-Shot, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Autofire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Autofire"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 5 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Energy\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Military"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Sniper-Rifle Mode"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When the ICWS is changed to Sniper-Rifle Mode, the weapon includes a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Targeting Scope"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Targeting_Scope","referenceId":"reference:d75342116ec32b75"}," (Standard), so there is no penalty to attack at Short ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},". However, the wielder takes a -2 penalty against targets at unmodified Point-Blank ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rifles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rifles","referenc